{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40542","headline":"晚泊汉江渡 · 刘畋","name":"晚泊汉江渡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"末秋云木轻，莲折晚香清。\n雨下侵苔色，云凉出浪声。\n叠帆依岸尽，微照夹堤明。\n渡吏已头白，遥知客姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘畋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}